<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<title>Knoll Lab</title>
<link rel="icon" href="../logo/logo-icon.svg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<!-- Sora + Public Sans are the house faces; the other four belong to the genre
     skins in themes.css — Cormorant/Special Elite to horror, Cinzel to
     adventure, Chakra Petch to shooter. -->
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@600;700&family=Special+Elite&family=Cinzel:wght@600;700;800&family=Chakra+Petch:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="lab.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="themes.css">
<script>
  /* the saved genre skin, applied before the first paint — leave this here and
     inline, or the page flashes cream on its way to whatever it actually is */
  try {
    var t = localStorage.getItem('knoll-lab:theme');
    document.documentElement.dataset.theme =
      ['knoll','horror','adventure','shooter'].indexOf(t) >= 0 ? t : 'knoll';
  } catch (e) { document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'knoll'; }
</script>
</head>
<body>

<header class="lab-head">
  <a class="lab-brand" href="../">
    <img src="../logo/logo-icon.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26">
    <span>knoll</span><span class="lab-slash">/</span><span class="lab-name">lab</span>
  </a>
  <p class="lab-hint">a workbench for things that aren't ready yet. the bench moves like figma's canvas: hold the <b>scroll wheel</b> (or <b>space</b>) and drag to pan, scroll to pan, <b>ctrl+scroll</b> or pinch to zoom — the <b>?</b> in the corner has the rest. drag gizmos by their handles; double-click a handle to send it home, or press its – to put it back on the shelf. switch who you're viewing as with the buttons (or keys 1 / 2 / 3), and what the place is dressed as with <b>genre</b> (or shift+g). the dock at the bottom draws on the paper itself — pick a tool, pick a colour, and <b>esc</b> puts the pen down. Click a colour a second time to mix your own (alt-click puts the house one back), and the draw tool's <b>pixel</b> setting squares the pen off so it fills the grid a cell at a time. The <b>+</b> on the dock puts a picture up — one off your own machine, or a gif searched out of KLIPY — and it stays on the pointer, so the next click puts up another.</p>
  <div class="role-switch" role="tablist" aria-label="view as">
    <span class="role-switch-label">VIEW AS</span>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-role-btn="user" aria-selected="true"><i>1</i>User</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-role-btn="moderator" aria-selected="false"><i>2</i>Moderator</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" data-role-btn="owner" aria-selected="false"><i>3</i>Site owner</button>
  </div>
  <!-- what the place is dressed as. Built by theme.js; sits next to VIEW AS
       because the pair answers the same kind of question about the bench. -->
  <div class="genre-switch" id="genre-switch" role="tablist" aria-label="genre skin"></div>
  <div class="lab-tools">
    <button type="button" id="lab-reset" class="lab-link">reset layout</button>
    <button type="button" id="lab-reset-data" class="lab-link">reset data</button>
    <a class="lab-link" href="../">← coming soon page</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="bench" class="bench" aria-label="workbench">

  <!-- role strip: what the current role will be able to do here. Anything with
       data-roles="moderator owner" (space/comma separated) is hidden for other roles. -->
  <div class="role-strip" id="role-strip">
    <span class="role-badge" id="role-badge">user</span>
    <span data-roles="user">what any visitor sees. nothing to manage yet — just the gizmos.</span>
    <span data-roles="moderator">moderator view. review queues and flags will land here.</span>
    <span data-roles="owner">site-owner view. settings, members and the kill-switches will land here.</span>
  </div>

  <!-- the world: everything on the bench lives in here so the whole sheet can
       zoom. It is not painted — the bench's grid shows through it — so the
       canvas has no edge; this is only the frame the gizmos hang in. -->
  <div id="bench-world" class="bench-world">

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 01 · CHARACTER FORGE ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz" id="gz-forge" data-gizmo="forge" aria-label="Character Forge">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">CHARACTER FORGE <b>MK.I</b></span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0001</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="gz-body">

      <!-- 01 · INTAKE -->
      <div class="gz-col gz-intake">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> INTAKE</div>
        <label class="hopper" id="hopper" for="forge-file">
          <input type="file" id="forge-file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" hidden>
          <div class="hopper-empty">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="38" height="38" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="6" y="10" width="36" height="28" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <circle cx="17" cy="20" r="3.5" fill="currentColor"/>
              <path d="M8 34l11-10 7 7 6-5 8 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            <strong>drop a png / jpg</strong>
            <span>or click to browse · clean backgrounds cut best</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hopper-full" hidden>
            <img id="specimen" alt="specimen">
            <span class="hopper-tag">SPECIMEN</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hopper-slot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </label>
        <div class="intake-row">
          <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="forge-sample">use a sample</button>
          <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="forge-eject" disabled>eject</button>
        </div>
        <dl class="readout" id="readout">
          <div><dt>SEED</dt><dd data-r="seed">— — — —</dd></div>
          <div><dt>PX</dt><dd data-r="px">— × —</dd></div>
          <div><dt>HUE</dt><dd data-r="hue">—</dd></div>
          <div><dt>STATUS</dt><dd data-r="status" class="readout-status">idle</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="gz-fine">stays on your device — nothing is uploaded anywhere.</p>

        <!-- the bin: drag a critter off the bench and drop it in -->
        <div class="bin" id="forge-bin" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="the bin — drag a critter in, or press to empty the bench">
          <div class="bin-stage">
            <span class="bin-puff" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <svg class="bin-can" viewBox="0 0 64 76" width="62" height="74" aria-hidden="true">
              <g class="bin-lid">
                <rect x="24" y="4" width="16" height="6" rx="3" class="bin-knob"/>
                <rect x="6" y="10" width="52" height="10" rx="4"/>
              </g>
              <path class="bin-body" d="M11 24h42l-4.5 44a5 5 0 0 1-5 4.5H20.5a5 5 0 0 1-5-4.5z"/>
              <g class="bin-ribs">
                <line x1="24" y1="32" x2="22.5" y2="64"/>
                <line x1="32" y1="32" x2="32" y2="64"/>
                <line x1="40" y1="32" x2="41.5" y2="64"/>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="bin-cap"><b>THE BIN</b><span id="forge-binned">drag a critter in</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 · ANALYSIS -->
      <div class="gz-col gz-analysis">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> ANALYSIS</div>
        <div class="gauges">
          <figure class="gauge" data-gauge="hue">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 48" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 44 A32 32 0 0 1 72 44" class="gauge-arc"/>
              <g class="gauge-ticks">
                <line x1="8" y1="44" x2="13" y2="44"/><line x1="17.4" y1="21.4" x2="21" y2="25"/>
                <line x1="40" y1="12" x2="40" y2="17"/><line x1="62.6" y1="21.4" x2="59" y2="25"/>
                <line x1="72" y1="44" x2="67" y2="44"/>
              </g>
              <line class="gauge-needle" x1="40" y1="44" x2="40" y2="16"/>
              <circle cx="40" cy="44" r="3.5" class="gauge-pin"/>
            </svg>
            <figcaption>HUE</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="gauge" data-gauge="chaos">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 48" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 44 A32 32 0 0 1 72 44" class="gauge-arc"/>
              <g class="gauge-ticks">
                <line x1="8" y1="44" x2="13" y2="44"/><line x1="17.4" y1="21.4" x2="21" y2="25"/>
                <line x1="40" y1="12" x2="40" y2="17"/><line x1="62.6" y1="21.4" x2="59" y2="25"/>
                <line x1="72" y1="44" x2="67" y2="44"/>
              </g>
              <line class="gauge-needle" x1="40" y1="44" x2="40" y2="16"/>
              <circle cx="40" cy="44" r="3.5" class="gauge-pin"/>
            </svg>
            <figcaption>CHAOS</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="gauge" data-gauge="lumen">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 48" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M8 44 A32 32 0 0 1 72 44" class="gauge-arc"/>
              <g class="gauge-ticks">
                <line x1="8" y1="44" x2="13" y2="44"/><line x1="17.4" y1="21.4" x2="21" y2="25"/>
                <line x1="40" y1="12" x2="40" y2="17"/><line x1="62.6" y1="21.4" x2="59" y2="25"/>
                <line x1="72" y1="44" x2="67" y2="44"/>
              </g>
              <line class="gauge-needle" x1="40" y1="44" x2="40" y2="16"/>
              <circle cx="40" cy="44" r="3.5" class="gauge-pin"/>
            </svg>
            <figcaption>LUMEN</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="dial-note">
          <span>drag a needle to overrule the picture · double-click it to re-read</span>
          <button type="button" id="forge-auto">auto</button>
        </div>

        <div class="leds" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="led led-green on" data-led="pwr"></span><small>PWR</small>
          <span class="led led-amber" data-led="spec"></span><small>SPEC</small>
          <span class="led led-pink" data-led="busy"></span><small>BUSY</small>
          <span class="led led-blue" data-led="out"></span><small>OUT</small>
        </div>

        <div class="detail" role="group" aria-label="detail">
          <span>DETAIL</span>
          <button type="button" data-detail="24" aria-pressed="false" title="24 cells across · 8 colours">LO</button>
          <button type="button" data-detail="40" aria-pressed="true" title="40 cells across · 12 colours">MID</button>
          <button type="button" data-detail="64" aria-pressed="false" title="64 cells across · 18 colours">HI</button>
          <button type="button" data-detail="100" aria-pressed="false" title="100 cells across · 32 colours — near enough the picture itself">EX</button>
        </div>

        <div class="forge-well">
          <button type="button" class="forge-btn" id="forge-go" disabled>
            <span>FORGE</span>
          </button>
          <div class="forge-sub">press again to re-roll the face &amp; limbs</div>
          <!-- the two next to the big button: one puts the whole machine back
               to nothing, one scrambles the warp bench. Shake used to live down
               in the warp row and moved up here to sit beside its opposite. -->
          <div class="forge-well-row">
            <button type="button" id="forge-reset" title="put the whole machine back to nothing">reset</button>
            <button type="button" id="forge-shake" title="scramble the warp bench">shake</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="odometer" aria-label="batch counter">
          <span>BATCH</span><b id="forge-count">0000</b>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 · OUTPUT -->
      <div class="gz-col gz-output">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> OUTPUT</div>
        <div class="screen" id="screen">
          <canvas id="forge-canvas" width="340" height="440" aria-label="forged character"></canvas>
          <div class="screen-idle" id="screen-idle">INSERT<br>SPECIMEN<span class="cursor">▮</span></div>
          <div class="screen-glass" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <label class="size-set" id="size-set" title="how big it walks the bench — half to double. double-click to reset.">
          <span>SIZE</span>
          <input type="range" id="forge-size" min="50" max="200" step="5" value="100">
          <b id="forge-size-v">×1</b>
        </label>
        <div class="nameplate" id="nameplate" hidden>
          <h3 class="name-row">
            <input id="char-name" class="name-in" maxlength="42" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" aria-label="creature name" placeholder="unnamed">
            <button type="button" id="name-roll" title="roll another name" aria-label="roll another name">⟳</button>
          </h3>
          <p id="char-traits">—</p>
          <ul class="stats" id="char-stats">
            <li><span>VIBE</span><i><b data-stat="vibe"></b></i><em></em></li>
            <li><span>CHAOS</span><i><b data-stat="chaos"></b></i><em></em></li>
            <li><span>GLOW</span><i><b data-stat="glow"></b></i><em></em></li>
            <li><span>HEFT</span><i><b data-stat="heft"></b></i><em></em></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="out-row">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="forge-save">save png</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 04 · WARP -->
      <div class="gz-warp">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> WARP BENCH</div>
        <div class="warp-grid">
          <label class="warp-set"><span>STRETCH</span><input type="range" data-warp="stretch" min="-100" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="squat and wide ↔ tall and thin"><b>·</b></label>
          <label class="warp-set"><span>LEAN</span><input type="range" data-warp="lean" min="-100" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="shear it over to one side"><b>·</b></label>
          <label class="warp-set"><span>WAVE</span><input type="range" data-warp="wave" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="ripple the rows sideways"><b>·</b></label>
          <label class="warp-set"><span>MELT</span><input type="range" data-warp="melt" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="let the bottom drip"><b>·</b></label>
          <label class="warp-set"><span>TWIST</span><input type="range" data-warp="twist" min="-100" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="swirl around the middle"><b>·</b></label>
          <label class="warp-set"><span>BULGE</span><input type="range" data-warp="bulge" min="-100" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="pinch ↔ fisheye"><b>·</b></label>
          <label class="warp-set"><span>GLITCH</span><input type="range" data-warp="glitch" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="tear it into slipped bands"><b>·</b></label>
          <label class="warp-set"><span>BLUR</span><input type="range" data-warp="blur" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0" title="throw it out of focus"><b>·</b></label>
        </div>
        <div class="warp-row">
          <p class="gz-fine">bends the finished creature — on the screen and on the bench. double-click a slider to flatten it.</p>
          <button type="button" id="warp-reset">flat</button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 02 · THE PETITION BOARD ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-petition" id="gz-petition" data-gizmo="petition" aria-label="The petition board">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE PETITION BOARD</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0002</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body pb-body">
      <div class="gz-col pb-board">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE BOARD</div>
        <div class="pb-loop" id="pb-loop" aria-label="the loop">
          <span data-phase="ask">ask</span><i>→</i><span data-phase="vote">vote</span><i>→</i><span data-phase="pass">pass</span><i>→</i><span data-phase="dig">dig</span><i>↺</i>
        </div>
        <form class="pb-ask" id="pb-ask" autocomplete="off">
          <input id="pb-q" maxlength="90" placeholder="put a daft question to the hill…">
          <button class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" type="submit">pin it</button>
        </form>
        <div class="pb-review" id="pb-review"></div>
        <ul class="pb-list" id="pb-list"></ul>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">one vote per question. tap your vote again to take it back.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you read new questions first, can close a vote early, and can take a question down.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you can do everything a moderator can, plus dig, drain, move the line and stir the hill.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gz-col pb-side">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE HILL</div>
        <div class="hill"><canvas id="pb-hill" width="300" height="150"></canvas></div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="pb-hill-cap"></p>
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> THE LAW BOOK</div>
        <ol class="lawbook" id="pb-law"></ol>
        <div class="pb-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> OWNER&#39;S DESK</div>
          <label class="pb-range">the line <input type="range" id="pb-quorum" min="2" max="12"><b id="pb-quorum-v"></b></label>
          <label class="pb-check"><input type="checkbox" id="pb-review-toggle"> a moderator reads new questions first</label>
          <div class="intake-row">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="pb-stir">stir the hill</button>
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="pb-wipe">wipe the board</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 03 · THE WORKSHOP SHED ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-shed" id="gz-shed" data-gizmo="shed" aria-label="The workshop shed">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE WORKSHOP SHED</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0003</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body sh-body">
      <div class="gz-col sh-view">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE SHED</div>
        <div class="shed"><canvas id="sh-canvas" width="380" height="230"></canvas></div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="sh-cap"></p>
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> SCREWED TO THE HILL</div>
        <div class="hill"><canvas id="sh-hill" width="300" height="120"></canvas></div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="sh-hill-cap"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="gz-col sh-side">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> THE ROADMAP</div>
        <ul class="sh-list" id="sh-list"></ul>
        <form class="pb-ask" id="sh-add" data-roles="owner" autocomplete="off">
          <input id="sh-title" maxlength="60" placeholder="a new contraption…">
          <button class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" type="submit">under a tarp</button>
        </form>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">tarps stay tarps until something is on the bench. gnome&#39;s orders.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can peek under tarps and leave notes; only the owner moves things.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">slide progress, move things bench ⇄ tarp, and ship. the gnome does the rest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 04 · THE MUSEUM ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-museum" id="gz-museum" data-gizmo="museum" aria-label="The museum">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE MUSEUM</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0004</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body mu-body">
      <div class="gz-col mu-floor">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE EASELS · <b class="mu-cycle-n" id="mu-cycle">CYCLE —</b></div>
        <ul class="mu-easels" id="mu-easels"></ul>
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> SUBMIT</div>
        <form class="mu-submit" id="mu-form" autocomplete="off">
          <div class="mu-pad-host" id="mu-pad-host"></div>
          <div class="mu-fields">
            <input id="mu-title" maxlength="40" placeholder="what is it called…" aria-label="title">
            <input id="mu-sign" maxlength="24" placeholder="signed…" aria-label="signature">
            <button class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" type="submit">onto an easel</button>
            <p class="gz-fine">unsigned work goes down as anonymous, like most of the good stuff.</p>
          </div>
        </form>
        <p class="mu-status" id="mu-status" aria-live="polite">the museum is open. admission is free.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">draw, sign, submit. one vote per drawing — tap the star again to take it back.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can take a drawing down off its easel. the wall itself is beyond you.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you close the cycle: one drawing framed forever, the rest built over. no appeals.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gz-col mu-side">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> THE WALL</div>
        <div class="mu-wall" id="mu-wall"></div>
        <p class="mu-fallen" id="mu-fallen">built over: —</p>
        <div class="mu-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> OWNER&#39;S DESK</div>
          <div class="mu-desk-row">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="mu-close">close the cycle</button>
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="mu-dust">dust the museum</button>
          </div>
          <p class="gz-fine">closing frames the top-voted drawing and builds over the rest. dusting forgets the lot.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 05 · THE NAMING CEREMONY ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-naming" id="gz-naming" data-gizmo="naming" aria-label="The naming ceremony">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE NAMING CEREMONY</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0005</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body nm-body">
      <div class="gz-col nm-main">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> AWAITING NAMES</div>
        <div class="nm-banner" id="nm-banner" hidden><b>BY ORDER OF THE HILL</b><span id="nm-banner-text"></span></div>
        <ul class="nm-list" id="nm-list"></ul>
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE HILL</div>
        <div class="hill"><canvas id="nm-hill" width="300" height="140"></canvas></div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="nm-hill-cap"></p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">one vote per landmark. putting a name forward takes your vote with it; tap another name and the vote walks over.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can strike a name off a ballot. it stays up, crossed out, so everyone can see what was nearly allowed.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you set the line, can christen a name straight through, and can make the hill mutter.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gz-col nm-side">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> THE REGISTER</div>
        <ul class="nm-register" id="nm-register"></ul>
        <p class="gz-fine">names stick forever. nothing here un-names.</p>
        <div class="nm-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> OWNER&#39;S DESK</div>
          <label class="pb-range">the line <input type="range" id="nm-line" min="2" max="8"><b id="nm-line-v"></b></label>
          <div class="nm-desk-row">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="nm-stir">the hill mutters</button>
          </div>
          <p class="gz-fine">muttering is one to three stray votes. the hill has opinions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 06 · THE ELECTIONS ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-elections" id="gz-elections" data-gizmo="elections" aria-label="The elections">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE ELECTIONS</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0006</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body el-body">
      <div class="gz-col el-office">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE OFFICE</div>
        <div class="el-portrait" id="el-portrait"></div>
        <div class="el-plaque" id="el-plaque"></div>
        <div class="el-term" id="el-term" hidden>
          <div class="el-term-top"><span>TERM</span><b id="el-term-txt">day — of —</b></div>
          <div class="el-term-bar"><i id="el-term-fill"></i></div>
        </div>
        <p class="gz-fine">powers: none. duties: wandering. the sash is dry-clean only.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gz-col el-race">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE RACE</div>
        <ul class="el-list" id="el-list"></ul>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="el-when"></p>
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> STAND</div>
        <form class="el-stand" id="el-stand" autocomplete="off">
          <input id="el-name" maxlength="24" placeholder="your name…" aria-label="candidate name">
          <input id="el-slogan" maxlength="48" placeholder="a modest promise…" aria-label="campaign slogan">
          <button class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" type="submit">stand for mayor</button>
        </form>
        <p class="el-standing" id="el-standing" hidden>you&#39;re on the ballot. straighten your hat.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">one vote, and it moves with you. one candidacy per device. the mayor cannot help you.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can strike a candidate off the ballot, or pardon them back on. strike sparingly — gnomes remember.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you can count the ballots early, dissolve the office, and make the hill turn out.</p>
        <div class="el-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> RETURNING OFFICER</div>
          <div class="el-desk-row">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="el-count">count the ballots</button>
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="el-stir">the hill turns out</button>
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="el-dissolve">dissolve the office</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 07 · THE LAW BOOK ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-lawbook" id="gz-lawbook" data-gizmo="lawbook" aria-label="The law book">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE LAW BOOK</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0007</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body lb-body">
      <div class="gz-col lb-col">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE SPREAD</div>
        <div class="lb-book">
          <div class="lb-page lb-page-left">
            <h4 class="lb-ph">The Law of the Hill</h4>
            <div class="lb-scroll" aria-label="the articles">
              <p class="lb-preamble">We, the assembled of the hill, being of sound-ish mind and one shared lawn, set down what has carried.</p>
              <div id="lb-articles"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="lb-sealfoot" id="lb-sealed"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="lb-spine" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="lb-page lb-page-right">
            <h4 class="lb-ph">The Changelog</h4>
            <ol class="lb-scroll lb-log-list" id="lb-log" aria-label="the changelog"></ol>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lb-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE WAX SEAL</div>
          <div class="lb-seal-row">
            <button type="button" class="lb-seal" id="lb-seal" aria-label="stamp the book"><span>SEAL</span></button>
            <p class="gz-fine">press to stamp what has carried. press again whenever history moves — the wax doesn&#39;t mind.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">you read. that is the whole role, and honestly the best one.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you keep the margins tidy. there is no button for this — it is more of a calling.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you apply the seal. the law is exactly as binding either way.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 08 · THE MONUMENT ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-monument" id="gz-monument" data-gizmo="monument" aria-label="The monument">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE MONUMENT</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0008</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body mo-body">
      <div class="gz-col mo-site">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE SITE</div>
        <div class="mo-yard"><canvas id="mo-canvas" width="300" height="340" aria-label="the monument, mid-build"></canvas></div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="mo-cap"></p>
        <div class="mo-plaque" id="mo-plaque" hidden>
          <b class="mo-plaque-top">RAISED BY THE HILL</b>
          <div class="mo-plaque-names" id="mo-plaque-names"></div>
          <span class="mo-plaque-date" id="mo-plaque-date"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gz-col mo-side">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE SCAFFOLDING</div>
        <div class="mo-bar"><i id="mo-bar-fill"></i></div>
        <p class="mo-count" id="mo-count">— of — blocks</p>
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> YOUR BLOCK</div>
        <div class="mo-crew">
          <input id="mo-name" maxlength="18" placeholder="your mark…" autocomplete="off" aria-label="your mark on the block">
          <button type="button" class="mo-btn" id="mo-place">place your block</button>
          <p class="mo-shift" id="mo-shift"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="mo-safety" data-roles="moderator owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> SITE SAFETY</div>
          <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="mo-prise">prise out a wonky block</button>
        </div>
        <div class="mo-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>05</i> OWNER&#39;S DESK</div>
          <div class="intake-row">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="mo-lend">the hill lends a hand</button>
          </div>
          <div class="intake-row">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="mo-next">call the next shift</button>
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="mo-raze">tear it down</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">one block per shift, signed or not. the ledger remembers either way.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can prise out a wonky block — the last one laid. the hill pretends not to notice.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you call the shifts, borrow the hill&#39;s hands, and — if it must be said — tear the whole thing down.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 09 · THE TIME CAPSULE ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-capsule" id="gz-capsule" data-gizmo="capsule" aria-label="The time capsule">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE TIME CAPSULE</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0009</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body tc-body">
      <div class="gz-col tc-site">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE DIG SITE</div>
        <div class="tc-dig" id="tc-dig"><canvas id="tc-canvas" width="340" height="230" aria-label="a cross-section of the hill, chest included"></canvas></div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="tc-cap"></p>
        <div class="tc-listen" data-roles="moderator owner">
          <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="tc-shake">give it a shake</button>
          <span class="tc-rattle" id="tc-rattle"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gz-col tc-post">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE DEPOSIT</div>
        <form class="tc-form" id="tc-form" autocomplete="off">
          <div class="tc-tabs" role="group" aria-label="what goes in">
            <button type="button" class="tc-tab" id="tc-tab-note" aria-pressed="true">a note</button>
            <button type="button" class="tc-tab" id="tc-tab-draw" aria-pressed="false">a drawing</button>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-well">
            <textarea class="tc-note" id="tc-note" maxlength="140" rows="3" placeholder="to whoever digs this up…"></textarea>
            <div id="tc-pad" hidden></div>
            <label class="tc-signrow"><span>SIGNED</span><input id="tc-sign" maxlength="24" placeholder="anonymous"></label>
            <div class="tc-lower"><button type="submit" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="tc-lower-btn">lower it in</button></div>
          </div>
        </form>
        <p class="tc-shut" id="tc-shut" hidden></p>
        <p class="tc-count" id="tc-count"></p>
        <div class="tc-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> OWNER&#39;S DESK</div>
          <label class="tc-date"><span>the day</span><input type="date" id="tc-date"></label>
          <div class="tc-deskrow">
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="tc-seal">seal it now</button>
            <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="tc-crack">crack it open early</button>
          </div>
          <div class="tc-deskrow"><button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="tc-fresh" hidden>bury a fresh one</button></div>
        </div>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">one keepsake per device — a note or a drawing, not both. no take-backs; that is what buried means.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can give the chest a shake and hear roughly how full it is. roughly.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you set the day, seal the lid, crack it early — and after the spill, bury a fresh one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tc-spill" id="tc-spill" hidden>
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> THE SPILL</div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="tc-spill-cap"></p>
        <div class="tc-spill-grid" id="tc-spill-grid"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>


  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 10 · THE BUG FARM ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-bugfarm" id="gz-bugfarm" data-gizmo="bugfarm" aria-label="The bug farm">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE BUG FARM</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0010</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body bf-body">

      <div class="gz-col bf-col-tank">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE VIVARIUM</div>
        <div class="bf-tank" id="bf-tank">
          <canvas id="bf-canvas" width="360" height="240" aria-label="a glass tank with every reported bug in it, each one the size of how many people have hit it"></canvas>
        </div>
        <p class="hill-cap" id="bf-cap"></p>
        <p class="bf-count" id="bf-count"></p>
        <div class="pb-mod bf-jar" data-roles="owner">
          <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="bf-shake">shake the jar</button>
          <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="bf-empty">empty the tank</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gz-col bf-col-list">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE LEDGER</div>
        <ul class="bf-list" id="bf-list"></ul>
      </div>

      <div class="gz-col bf-col-report">
        <div class="gz-label bf-board-head"><i>03</i> SEEN SOMETHING?</div>
        <form class="bf-form" id="bf-form" autocomplete="off">
          <textarea id="bf-what" maxlength="90" rows="2" placeholder="what went wrong? one line."></textarea>
          <label class="bf-row"><span>WHERE</span><select id="bf-where"></select></label>
          <label class="bf-row"><span>WHO</span><input id="bf-who" maxlength="20" placeholder="anonymous"></label>
          <button type="submit" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="bf-let">let it loose</button>
        </form>
        <p class="bf-status" id="bf-status"></p>
        <div class="gz-label bf-swat-head"><i>04</i> THE SWATTED</div>
        <ul class="bf-swatted" id="bf-swatted"></ul>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">one me-too per bug — tap the bug in the tank, or the button in the ledger. every one it gets, it grows.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can mark one <b>can’t reproduce</b>. it rolls over, stops growing, and waits to be believed.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you swat them, and a swatted bug is a fixed bug — it goes up on the board with the date on it.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>


  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 11 · THE DISPENSARY ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-vending" id="gz-vending" data-gizmo="vending" aria-label="The dispensary">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE DISPENSARY <b>MK.I</b></span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0011</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body vm-body">

      <div class="gz-col vm-col-machine">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE MACHINE</div>
        <div class="vm-machine">
          <canvas id="vm-canvas" width="300" height="250" aria-label="a vending machine full of capsules, with a countdown to the next free one"></canvas>
        </div>
        <p class="vm-led" id="vm-led"></p>
        <button type="button" class="gz-btn vm-pull" id="vm-pull">turn the knob</button>
        <p class="bf-status" id="vm-status"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="gz-col vm-col-prize">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> WHAT CAME OUT</div>
        <div class="vm-prize empty" id="vm-prize"></div>
        <p class="vm-peek" id="vm-peek" data-roles="moderator owner"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="gz-col vm-col-cabinet">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>04</i> THE CABINET</div>
        <ul class="vm-cabinet" id="vm-cabinet"></ul>
        <p class="vm-have" id="vm-have"></p>
        <div class="vm-sticker">
          <b class="vm-odds-head">THE ODDS</b>
          <ul class="vm-odds" id="vm-odds"></ul>
          <p class="vm-pity" id="vm-pity"></p>
          <p class="vm-printed">printed on the side, because we are not monsters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vm-desk" data-roles="owner">
          <div class="gz-label"><i>05</i> THE ROUND</div>
          <label class="bf-row"><span>EVERY</span>
            <select id="vm-every">
              <option value="30000">30 seconds</option>
              <option value="90000">90 seconds</option>
              <option value="600000">10 minutes</option>
              <option value="3600000">an hour</option>
              <option value="21600000">six hours</option>
              <option value="86400000">a day</option>
            </select></label>
          <label class="bf-row"><span>BANKS</span>
            <select id="vm-cap">
              <option value="1">1 capsule</option>
              <option value="2">2 capsules</option>
              <option value="3">3 capsules</option>
              <option value="5">5 capsules</option>
            </select></label>
          <label class="bf-row"><span>RIG</span>
            <select id="vm-rig">
              <option value="">the printed odds</option>
              <option value="common">common</option>
              <option value="uncommon">uncommon</option>
              <option value="rare">rare</option>
              <option value="oneoff">one of a kind</option>
            </select></label>
          <div class="pb-mod">
            <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="vm-restock">restock now</button>
            <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="vm-empty">empty their pockets</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-mod vm-modrow" data-roles="moderator owner">
          <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="vm-broken">hang the out-of-order sign</button>
        </div>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">it takes time, not money. one capsule every so often, a few bank up, and it keeps counting while you are away.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can see what is loaded next, and hang the sign if it is being got at.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you set the round, rig the next one, and can empty a cabinet. all three are a choice.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>


  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 12 · THE SOUND DESK ───────────────────────── -->
  <!-- staff only: a visitor gets the speaker in the zoom dock and nothing else -->
  <section class="gz gz-sound" id="gz-sound" data-gizmo="sound" aria-label="The sound desk" data-roles="moderator owner">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE SOUND DESK <b>MK.I</b></span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0012</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body sd-body">

      <div class="gz-col sd-col-deck">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE DESK</div>
        <div class="sd-deck">
          <div class="sd-top">
            <div class="sd-screen">
              <b class="sd-now" id="sd-now">—</b>
              <i class="sd-by" id="sd-by">—</i>
              <div class="sd-prog"><span id="sd-bar"></span></div>
              <span class="sd-time" id="sd-time">0:00 / 0:00</span>
            </div>
            <canvas class="sd-vu" id="sd-vu" width="104" height="58" aria-label="the level, on a needle"></canvas>
          </div>
          <div class="sd-knobs" id="sd-knobs"></div>
          <div class="sd-flips" id="sd-flips"></div>
          <div class="sd-transport">
            <button type="button" class="sd-tp" id="sd-prev" aria-label="the one before">⏮</button>
            <button type="button" class="sd-tp sd-tp-big" id="sd-play" aria-label="play">▶</button>
            <button type="button" class="sd-tp" id="sd-next" aria-label="the next one">⏭</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="bf-status" id="sd-status">nothing is playing. press the big one.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine">every note is made up on the spot — there is not an audio file anywhere in this project. drag a knob, double-click it to put it back.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gz-col sd-col-list">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> THE PLAYLIST</div>
        <ul class="pl-list" id="sd-list"></ul>
        <p class="gz-fine">the same six the coming-soon page pretends to play. these ones are real, in the sense that anything generated is real.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 13 · THE ZOETROPE ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-zoetrope" id="gz-zoetrope" data-gizmo="zoetrope" aria-label="The zoetrope">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE ZOETROPE</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0013</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body zt-body">

      <!-- 01 · THE DRUM -->
      <div class="gz-col zt-drum-col">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE DRUM</div>
        <div class="zt-drop" id="zt-drop">
          <svg class="zt-drop-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 40" width="46" height="38" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="2.5" y="6.5" width="43" height="31" rx="5"/>
            <path d="M2.5 28 15 18l9 7 7-5 14.5 10.5"/>
            <circle cx="33" cy="15" r="3.6"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="zt-drop-word">drop a picture here<small>or paste one · png, jpeg, gif, webp, svg</small></span>
          <button type="button" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="zt-pick">choose a picture</button>
          <input type="file" id="zt-file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp,image/avif,image/svg+xml" hidden>
        </div>
        <p class="zt-status" id="zt-status"></p>
        <p class="gz-fine">it goes up on the paper in the middle of what you are looking at — or exactly where you dropped it, if you dropped it on the paper itself. a gif turns; a still sits there.</p>
        <p class="zt-mark"><span>kept on this device · never uploaded</span></p>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 · ON THE PAPER -->
      <div class="gz-col zt-wall-col">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> ON THE PAPER</div>
        <p class="zt-count" id="zt-count">nothing up yet</p>
        <ul class="zt-list" id="zt-wall"></ul>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">drag a pinned picture anywhere on the paper. click one to dress it up. you can take down your own.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can take down anybody&#39;s, not just your own.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">the works, below, set how big they land and whether visitors may put any up.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 · THE WORKS -->
      <div class="gz-col zt-works" data-roles="owner">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> THE WORKS</div>
        <label class="zt-field"><span>HOW BIG THEY LAND</span>
          <select id="zt-land">
            <option value="small">small — 130 across</option>
            <option value="medium">medium — 190 across</option>
            <option value="large">large — 280 across</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <p class="zt-note">whatever goes in is shrunk to fit before it is kept — a photo out of a phone lands at about 60KB. a gif is kept whole, so it turns, and is refused rather than ruined if it is too big.</p>
        <label class="zt-check"><input type="checkbox" id="zt-open"><span>the drum is open to visitors</span></label>
        <p class="zt-room" id="zt-room">nothing kept on this device yet</p>
        <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="zt-clear">clear the paper</button>
        <p class="gz-fine">pictures live in this browser&#39;s own storage, which is a few megabytes for the whole bench. the drum asks for the room before it promises a picture, and says so plainly when there is none left.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>


  <!-- ───────────────────────── GIZMO 14 · THE TERMINAL ───────────────────────── -->
  <section class="gz gz-crt" id="gz-crt" data-gizmo="crt" aria-label="The terminal">
    <div class="gz-handle" data-handle>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="gz-plate">THE TERMINAL</span>
      <span class="gz-serial">№ KN-0014</span>
      <span class="gz-grip" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="gz-body crt-body">

      <!-- 01 · THE SET -->
      <div class="gz-col crt-set-col">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>01</i> THE SET</div>

        <!-- the monitor itself: hood, glass, vents, a stand and the slab of a
             keyboard under it — and the notes taped down its right-hand side -->
        <div class="crt-rig">
          <div class="crt-set">
            <div class="crt-hood">
              <div class="crt-glass">
                <ol class="crt-log" id="crt-log" aria-live="polite" aria-label="the board"></ol>
                <div class="crt-scan" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <div class="crt-bulge" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="crt-badge">
                <span class="crt-brand">KNOLLTRON <b>14&quot;</b></span>
                <span class="crt-count" id="crt-count">quiet</span>
                <span class="crt-led" id="crt-led" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="crt-vents" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          </div>
          <div class="crt-neck" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="crt-deck">
            <form class="crt-type" id="crt-type" autocomplete="off">
              <span class="crt-caret" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>
              <input type="text" id="crt-say" maxlength="140" placeholder="type something, then enter" aria-label="say something on the board">
              <button type="submit" class="gz-btn gz-btn-sm" id="crt-send">send</button>
            </form>
            <div class="crt-keys" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- the notes taped to the case. Read-only unless you are staff. -->
          <ul class="crt-stickies" id="crt-stickies" aria-label="notes on the case"></ul>
        </div>

        <p class="crt-status" id="crt-status" role="status"></p>
        <p class="gz-fine">the board is shared by every WINDOW of this page open on this machine — open the lab twice and the two really do talk. It cannot reach another machine; that needs a server, and there isn&#39;t one.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 · WHO&#39;S ON -->
      <div class="gz-col crt-who-col">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>02</i> WHO&#39;S ON</div>
        <label class="crt-field"><span>YOUR HANDLE</span>
          <input type="text" id="crt-name" maxlength="24" spellcheck="false" aria-label="your handle">
        </label>
        <ul class="crt-who" id="crt-who"></ul>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="user">your handle belongs to this window, not this device — a second window is somebody else, and a reload is still you. you can take back a line you said.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="moderator">you can take back anybody&#39;s line, and you write the notes taped to the case.</p>
        <p class="gz-fine" data-roles="owner">you write the notes, add and take them off, and the works below lock or wipe the board.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 · THE WORKS -->
      <div class="gz-col crt-works" data-roles="owner">
        <div class="gz-label"><i>03</i> THE WORKS</div>
        <label class="crt-check"><input type="checkbox" id="crt-open"><span>the board is open to visitors</span></label>
        <p class="gz-fine">locked, only moderators and you may type. everybody can still read it.</p>
        <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="crt-add">add a note to the case</button>
        <button type="button" class="pb-act" id="crt-clear">wipe the board</button>
        <p class="gz-fine">the last 120 lines are kept, on this device, and the oldest scroll off the top. nothing said here leaves the browser.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <div class="gz-feet" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
  </section>

  </div><!-- /bench-world -->

</main>

<!-- the shelf: every gizmo, benched or put away. lab.js fills the list. -->
<nav class="shelf" id="shelf" aria-label="the shelf">
  <div class="shelf-top">
    <b>THE SHELF</b>
    <button type="button" id="shelf-fold" aria-label="fold the shelf away">‹</button>
  </div>
  <ul class="shelf-list" id="shelf-list"></ul>
  <p class="shelf-fine">press a gizmo's – to put it back here.</p>
</nav>
<button type="button" class="shelf-tab" id="shelf-tab" hidden aria-label="open the shelf">SHELF</button>

<!-- the tool dock, as on the coming-soon hero: move / draw / sticker / text,
     five colours, undo, clear — and a row of options above it that only shows
     up when the chosen tool has any. Both are filled in by wall.js. -->
<div class="tool-opts" id="tool-opts" hidden aria-label="tool options"></div>
<div class="tool-dock" id="tool-dock" aria-label="drawing tools"></div>

<!-- zoom dock -->
<div class="zoom-dock" id="zoom-dock" aria-label="zoom">
  <button type="button" id="zoom-fit" title="fit everything on screen (shift 1)" aria-label="fit everything on screen">⤢</button>
  <span class="dock-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <button type="button" id="zoom-out" title="zoom out (−)">−</button>
  <button type="button" id="zoom-val" title="back to 100% (shift 0)">100%</button>
  <button type="button" id="zoom-in" title="zoom in (+)">+</button>
  <span class="dock-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <button type="button" id="vol-btn" class="vol-btn" aria-label="the sound">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" width="15" height="15" aria-hidden="true">
      <path class="vol-cone" d="M3 7h3l4-3.4v10.8L6 11H3z"/>
      <path class="vol-wave vol-w1" d="M12 6.6a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 0 4.8"/>
      <path class="vol-wave vol-w2" d="M14.1 4.4a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 0 9.2"/>
      <path class="vol-cross" d="M12.2 6.6l4.4 4.8M16.6 6.6l-4.4 4.8"/>
    </svg>
  </button>
  <input type="range" id="vol-slider" class="vol-slider" min="0" max="100" value="70" aria-label="how loud">
  <span class="dock-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <button type="button" id="zoom-keys" title="how to move about" aria-label="how to move about" aria-expanded="false">?</button>
</div>

<!-- how to move about -->
<div class="keymap" id="keymap" hidden>
  <b>MOVING ABOUT</b>
  <dl>
    <dt><kbd>wheel drag</kbd></dt><dd>hold the scroll wheel down and drag — pans from anywhere</dd>
    <dt><kbd>space</kbd><kbd>drag</kbd></dt><dd>the hand: pans over anything</dd>
    <dt><kbd>drag</kbd></dt><dd>bare paper pans; a gizmo's handle moves the gizmo</dd>
    <dt><kbd>scroll</kbd></dt><dd>pan up and down — <kbd>shift</kbd> for sideways</dd>
    <dt><kbd>ctrl</kbd><kbd>scroll</kbd></dt><dd>zoom about the pointer (pinch does too)</dd>
  </dl>
  <hr>
  <dl>
    <dt><kbd>+</kbd><kbd>−</kbd></dt><dd>zoom in and out</dd>
    <dt><kbd>shift</kbd><kbd>0</kbd></dt><dd>back to 100%</dd>
    <dt><kbd>shift</kbd><kbd>1</kbd></dt><dd>fit everything on screen</dd>
    <dt><kbd>h</kbd><kbd>v</kbd></dt><dd>hand tool, then back to the pointer</dd>
    <dt><kbd>1</kbd><kbd>2</kbd><kbd>3</kbd></dt><dd>view as user, moderator, owner</dd>
    <dt><kbd>shift</kbd><kbd>g</kbd></dt><dd>cycle the genre skin</dd>
    <dt><kbd>esc</kbd></dt><dd>drop the drawing tool, back to move</dd>
  </dl>
</div>

<script src="theme.js"></script>
<script src="lab.js"></script>
<script src="guide.js"></script>
<script src="hill.js"></script>
<script src="pad.js"></script>
<script src="note.js"></script>
<script src="fx.js"></script>
<script src="critters.js"></script>
<script src="forge.js"></script>
<script src="petition.js"></script>
<script src="workshop.js"></script>
<script src="museum.js"></script>
<script src="naming.js"></script>
<script src="elections.js"></script>
<script src="lawbook.js"></script>
<script src="monument.js"></script>
<script src="capsule.js"></script>
<script src="bugfarm.js"></script>
<script src="vending.js"></script>
<script src="sound.js"></script>
<script src="zoetrope.js"></script>
<script src="picture.js"></script>
<script src="crt.js"></script>
<script src="wall.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
